---
title: Weeknight chickpea stew
servings: 4
tags: [vegetarian, one-pot, weeknight]
source: Invented for this repository
---

Heat the @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #large pot{} over medium heat.

Add the @yellow onion{1}, diced, and cook ~{8%minutes} until soft and
translucent but not coloured. Stir in the @garlic{3%cloves}, chopped, and the
@ground cumin{2%tsp} and cook ~{1%minute} more.

Tip in the @tomatoes{400%g}, crushed by hand, and the @dried chickpeas{500%g}
that were soaked overnight and simmered until tender. Add @water{300%ml}.

Simmer uncovered ~{25%minutes}, stirring now and then, until the sauce coats a
spoon. Season with @flaked sea salt{} and @black pepper{}.

Finish with a spoon of @olive oil{} and serve with @bread{}.
